  "elevatorPitch": "CycleCipher is the world’s first truly private, Zero-Knowledge menstrual and symptom tracker for iPhone. It gives women pinpoint cycle and ovulation predictions while mathematically sealing their intimate health data on their device with military-grade AES-256 encryption. No ads, no data selling, and no predatory monthly subscriptions.",
