    "Pinpoint Cycle & Ovulation Forecasting: Real-time biological phase tracking (Menstrual, Follicular, Ovulatory, Luteal) with adaptive statistical modeling.",
    "Smart Body Pattern Recognition: On-device correlation engine linking cramps, mood swings, headaches, bloating, and energy levels.",
    "Discreet Mode & Face ID Lock: Biometric lock + disguised neutral lock-screen notifications.",
    "Clinically Referenced: Grounded in verified clinical guidelines from ACOG, NHS UK, and Mayo Clinic.",
    "No Monthly Subscription Traps: 30-Day Full-Access Free Trial, then a single €9.99 / $8.99 Lifetime purchase instead of $50/year subscriptions."
